7. **Use ISO 8601 dates** - Always UTC, always DateTime in C# (serializes to ISO strings automatically)
8. **Follow AG-UI protocol conventions** - Use standard event names (MESSAGE, STATE_SNAPSHOT, STATE_DELTA)

