    .Where(c => c.UserId == userId)
    .ToListAsync();

// ✅ CORRECT - Partition key in query
var conversations = await db.Conversations
    .Where(c => c.ThreadId == threadId)  // threadId is partition key
    .ToListAsync();
```

**❌ FORBIDDEN - Storing secrets in code or config files:**
```csharp
